# Voice Assistant

## Oasis Infobyte Python Programming Internship

### Task 1 - Voice Assistant

This project is a simple Voice Assistant developed using Python.

## Features
- Speaks responses using Microsoft Edge TTS
- Opens Google
- Opens YouTube
- Opens GitHub
- Tells the current time
- Exits on command

## Technologies Used
- Python
- edge-tts
- webbrowser
- datetime
- asyncio

## Commands
- hello
- time
- google
- youtube
- github
- exit

